msgid ""
"- ✅ **Full compatibility**: The basic path or feature combination is supported.\n"
"- 🟠 **Partial compatibility**: The basic path or feature combination is supported with the stated limitations.\n"
"- ❌ **No compatibility**: The backend or feature combination is not supported by the initial MRV2 PCP implementation.\n"
"- **Not applicable**: The feature does not apply to the attention backend."
msgstr ""
"- ✅ **完全兼容**：支持基本路径或功能组合。\n"
"- 🟠 **部分兼容**：支持基本路径或功能组合，但存在所述限制。\n"
"- ❌ **不兼容**：初始MRV2 PCP实现不支持该后端或功能组合。\n"
"- **不适用**：该功能不适用于此注意力后端。"

msgid "### Decode Context Parallel"
msgstr "### 解码上下文并行"

