msgstr "| Ascend 950 | SFA | ❌ 不兼容 | ❌ 不兼容 | ❌ 不兼容 | ❌ 不兼容 | ❌ 不兼容 | ❌ 不兼容 |"

msgid ""
"- ✅ **Full compatibility**: Combining the feature with DCP is supported.\n"
"- 🟠 **Partial compatibility**: Combining the feature with DCP is experimentally supported; interfaces and functionality may change.\n"
"- ❌ **No compatibility**: Combining the feature with DCP is not supported.\n"
"- **Not applicable**: The feature does not apply to this attention backend."
msgstr ""
"- ✅ **完全兼容**：支持将该功能与DCP组合。\n"
"- 🟠 **部分兼容**：将该功能与DCP组合为实验性支持；接口和功能可能会更改。\n"
"- ❌ **不兼容**：不支持将该功能与DCP组合。\n"
"- **不适用**：该功能不适用于此注意力后端。"

msgid ""
"Enable ModelRunner V2 and set `prefill_context_parallel_size` to the number "
"of PCP ranks:"
msgstr "启用ModelRunner V2并将`prefill_context_parallel_size`设置为PCP秩的数量："

msgid ""
"Unlike DCP, PCP adds extra ranks: `world_size_with_pcp = "
"prefill_context_parallel_size * original_world_size`."
msgstr ""
"与DCP不同，PCP会增加额外的秩：`world_size_with_pcp = prefill_context_parallel_size * "
"original_world_size`。"

msgid "#### Constraints"
msgstr "#### 约束"

msgid ""
"- PCP is supported only with ModelRunner V2.\n"
"- PCP and [DSA-CP](#dsa-cp) cannot be enabled simultaneously with the DSA backend."
msgstr ""
"- PCP仅支持ModelRunner V2。\n"
"- PCP和[DSA-CP](#dsa-cp)不能与DSA后端同时启用。"
